@annotation( rdfs:comment "A Beginning of Life Stasis (BoL) is a relatively brief Operational Stasis that is primarily of interest for the purpose of establishing a baseline for operational parameters to be compared to the designed specifications as well as the Artifact's performance throughout its operational life."@en )
